---
flowchart LR
    subgraph Modules["Module layers"]
        direction TB
        Entry["1. Application<br/>api · mcp · runtime · server.py"]
        Business["2. Business<br/>metadata · knowledge · user<br/>embedding · cron · migration<br/>compatibility (Trace / Search / Explorer)"]
        Shared["3. Infrastructure<br/>store · sql · process · heartbeat<br/>auth · model · db.py<br/>Backend adapters: store/neo4j, sql/connectors"]
        Foundation["4. Contracts<br/>schema · settings<br/>utils: shared leaf utilities"]
        Entry --> Business --> Shared --> Foundation
    end

    subgraph Flow["Plan write flow"]
        direction TB
        Input["API / MCP<br/>Bind trusted identity and Scope"]
        Draft["Business service calls Process<br/>NodeDraft / EdgeDraft"]
        Plan["Business service builds<br/>TransactionPlan"]
        Execute["Store executes atomically"]
        Result["TransactionResult"]
        Input --> Draft --> Plan --> Execute --> Result
    end

    Modules ~~~ Flow

